    "show_share": true,
    "description": "There is no worldwide agreement on one definition of Acute Paediatric Critical Illness- even though it is generally understood to be a serious disease process that can lead to death. The lack of consensus has made it difficult to pin down the number of children who develop this life-threatening condition.",
